{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_05",
  "title": "通往舞会的邀请函",
  "storyCode": "SS-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "80d7537bc135289190645359dd7f5dbf2a81d6a9b4818f7d194b34f5270b1b7f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "呼......呼......唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉闷的声音在空旷的洞穴中回荡，那是附近仍未停止作业的掘地机发出的声响。\n气温越来越低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "跑出洞穴的那一刻，寒意同时到来。\n而寒冷，只会让她心脏的跳动不断加快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "我该......该怎么面对她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无法开口，无法面对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啧啧啧，该如何是好呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无须回头，她已然知道来者是谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "这个孩子的梦境，我真的很满意呢~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "梦城堡的职责就是让每个孩子都有一场好梦，我一一实现了她的愿望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "没想到这个梦境意外地运行得很稳定——不，甚至完美无缺，完全超出了我的预期。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "而且在这里，有一些很有趣的事情正在发生哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "......你在欺骗她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "不不不，这可不算欺骗。我和她交易了很多次，她很清楚我的身份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "看到这个结果，我也很开心呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "就算意识到是梦境，依旧不愿意离开，那不正说明我的造梦技艺无人能比吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡尔顿们",
      "text": "（赞同的哼唧声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "哦，最后来的竟然是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "有点意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "text": "我就不打扰你们了~丰川祥子，相信你很快也会发现这个梦境的有趣之处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "祥子，大家都在等着你呢。回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "回哪去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "你看着莫菲丝消失，却没有一点惊讶......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "这里的一切，都是我们虚构出来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "“我们”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "你，不属于我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "text": "小睦，你弹得好棒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "祥......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "不对，妈妈......祥，她去哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "text": "小祥？可能去别的什么地方了吧......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若叶睦",
      "text": "不对，不对。祥......祥她不可能丢下我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "欢呼的人群突然变得一片死寂，所有人都直勾勾地盯着睦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "text": "小睦，你好像忘记了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母亲",
      "text": "这里不是你一个人的梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦的母亲”",
      "text": "这里是“我们”的梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "“我们”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "在这个梦境里，每一个“睦”都有机会实现自己的愿望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我们和小睦一起，构建出了只属于我们的美梦——大家都能得到幸福的梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我们在小睦的脑海中存在，观看了无数遍她的人生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "最后，我们一致认为，对于所有的“睦”来说，这就是最好的结局——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "而你，丰川祥子，你是这个美梦的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "睦，你这是在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "我也不希望你痛苦下去，但是我们都不该躲在这样的梦里——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "不，小睦能在这里幸福地生活下去才是最重要的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我和大家不一样，我想和祥子好好谈谈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你可以留在这里，和我一起，守护小睦的美梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "小睦是一个脆弱的孩子，她可能还无法决定，到底是醒来，还是就这样幸福下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "只要你也选择留在这里，帮我们一起让这个梦一直做下去，那它自然就会变成“现实”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你是“现实”唯一的基准，你即“现实”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "所以，留下来吧，祥子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "我拒绝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你......拒绝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "睦现实中的身体正躺在冰冷的梦城堡里，你觉得这样的结局也是好的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "你真的足够爱她的话，就不会做出这样的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "只要能让小睦开心，只要我们都能存在——是不是现实又有什么关系？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我拥有小睦的所有记忆，我知道你心里最需要什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "只要你愿意留在这里，我甚至能给你一个完整的Ave{@nbs}Mujica！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "闭嘴！你根本就不是睦......睦不会这样说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "我喜欢你，也喜欢小睦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "你为什么要让我陷入两难？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫名的声音盘旋在两人的头顶上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "远方的山脉好像在震动，地上的碎石也有节奏地跳动了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周围明明没有其他人，可祥子却觉得好像有无数双眼睛正在盯着自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "他们说得对。我们对于小睦来说，就是无数的影子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "为了让影子能一直躲在黑暗里，再微弱的光也要掐灭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“睦”一点点将祥子逼到了悬崖边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "......你要做什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "祥子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“睦”伸出了手，将手放在了祥子的肩上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子失去了平衡，“睦”离她越来越远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "祥子，我想要小睦一直快乐下去，我也想要所有的“睦”都不再消失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "可是我没有办法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "小睦，不需要你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”",
      "text": "永别了，祥子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
